# Catalog cards match Ethan

Ethan’s Catalog item card is the pattern for every service, including Models. Copy his latest chrome. Do not invent a Models-only card.

## Card chrome (required)

Same structure as Ethan’s latest cards (for example `cluster-node-sets-object`):

- Service icon, service chip, Live / Unpublished, kebab
- Display name as the title link
- Spec rows with Locked / Editable badges
- Rate
- Visibility footer (globe + Global public, or VIP)

**Do not** show the catalog item id (`cat-node-sets-fc430`, `cat-llm-instruct`, and similar) on the card.

If this repo’s copy of Ethan’s cards is behind his latest, **sync to his latest**. Do not keep extra fields on Models cards “so we don’t touch Ethan.”

## Display names

Use lowercase kebab-case object names, like Ethan:

- Yes: `cluster-node-sets-object`, `bare-metal-gpu-training-server`, `llm-instruct`
- No: `LLM — instruct`, `LLM — lightweight text gen`, `Cluster Node Sets`

The `cat-…` id stays in data only. It is not the title.

## Scope

Change Models catalog cards and any shared catalog chrome needed to match Ethan. Do not restyle Ethan’s bare metal / cluster / VM **offers** (different SKUs, rates, specs). Do match their **card pattern**.
